<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $40-3/4 (FIM 183.60).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $40-3/4 (FIM 183.60).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed $1-1/8 lower at $40-3/4 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 183.60 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday Nokia closed up 0.10 markka at 185.90.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) fell $0-1/2 to $32-7/8 on Wall Street overnight. The price equals about 74.06 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.30 markka to 74.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS fell $0-3/8 to $21 (94.61 markka) in New York. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 1.50 markka lower at 95.50. -- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
